WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.066
- I love the climb.

00:00:02.066 --> 00:00:04.361
I truly believe the 
definition of an entrepreneur

00:00:04.361 --> 00:00:05.956
is loving the process more

00:00:05.956 --> 00:00:07.849
than the things 
you get out of it.

00:00:07.849 --> 00:00:09.253
I don't like the stuff.

00:00:09.253 --> 00:00:11.409
I don't want watches.
Fuck cars.

00:00:11.409 --> 00:00:13.797
I don't need planes.
I don't need dick.

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:17.339
I need the process,
I need to buy the Jets, period.

00:00:17.339 --> 00:00:20.477
I truly believe that 
I will never really fully

00:00:20.477 --> 00:00:22.848
capitalize on all the money
or all the opportunities

00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:25.865
because I think I always leave
a little bit on the table

00:00:25.865 --> 00:00:28.447
because I want to keep playing.

00:00:28.447 --> 00:00:29.632
I want to keep playing.

00:00:29.632 --> 00:00:32.825
And I think that that's the
part that I'm curious about in

00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:35.843
the audience which is 
what's the divide for you

00:00:35.843 --> 00:00:37.832
between how much do you want
to keep playing and

00:00:37.832 --> 00:00:40.054
how much do you want the 
fruits that come along with

00:00:40.054 --> 00:00:42.545
success in winning the game?

00:00:42.545 --> 00:00:46.066
I find it stunningly
interesting that

00:00:46.066 --> 00:00:49.841
of course I like having money

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:53.231
but I am equally as happy

00:00:53.231 --> 00:00:58.877
right now as I was paying myself
$27,000 a year at 23 years old

00:00:58.877 --> 00:01:01.402
because the building of the game

00:01:01.402 --> 00:01:04.047
and I really do believe that 
separates me and

00:01:04.047 --> 00:01:05.905
the people in this 
audience that have that

00:01:05.905 --> 00:01:07.220
from the people that don't.

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:09.679
That they think it's a 
means to an end.

00:01:09.679 --> 00:01:11.739
That they'll make more 
money doing it themselves

00:01:11.739 --> 00:01:13.355
versus working for somebody.

00:01:13.355 --> 00:01:17.369
And to me that's the pure
definition of entrepreneurship.

00:01:17.369 --> 00:01:20.662
(light beat)

